-- Profession trainers: Forever's new recipes (Camp Tent, Fish Bowl, Incense Candle, Sharpening Wheel, the Novice sashes, Reagent Bot,
-- the copper and leather boots and belts, Mana Well, dyes and so on) were only on some trainers of each profession. 207 trainers that
-- teach the profession but missed them now teach them too, at the same cost, skill and level as the trainers that had them.
-- Recipe list per trainer from the AnoCore v13 world data (rows with a recorded source other than Wowhead); rank-up spells
-- (Apprentice .. Artisan) are not touched. Only adds rows. Safe to run again.
